# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opel_Corsa
# Vauxhall Corsa F: the PSA/Stellantis generation, five-door only, with the
# Corsa-e. Customer deliveries from January 2020; still on sale in 2026.
# UK registrations 46,572 (2020), 40,995 (2021), 35,976 (2025); the UK's
# best-selling car in 2021 and best-selling small car in Q1 2026.
#
# Colours: Quartz Grey, Diamond Black, Arctic White, Voltaic Blue. These are
# the four largest DVSA shares for 2020-2022 registrations: grey 25-26%, black
# 19.6-20.1%, white 16.9-17.7%, blue 16.9-17.7%. Red (9%) is the next colour
# and is not modelled. The 2023 facelift renamed the same shades Graphic Grey,
# Carbon Black and Contour White. Paint names are Vauxhall marketing names for
# the approximate shades; the render values are approximations.
#
# Dates are staggered per colour. Weights total 42 against the Focus's 99.
# Retire dates after 2026 are estimates for a model still in production.

